{"pageid":4088,"title":"Lost Woods","displaytitle":"<span class=\"mw-page-title-main\">Lost Woods</span>","revid":21643,"html":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p>The Lost Woods is a newly added area in <a href=\"/wiki/Finlay_Island\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Finlay Island\">Finlay island</a> as of May 2025's Terrain update, infested with zombies and skeletons, and rarely grUdge. It is low ground near the <a href=\"/wiki/Lighthouse\" title=\"Lighthouse\">Lighthouse</a>. There is a waterfall shielding a cave entrance to <a href=\"/wiki/Mike%27s_Mines\" title=\"Mike&#39;s Mines\">Mike's Mines</a>. \n</p><p><b><a href=\"/wiki/Petrified_Oak\" title=\"Petrified Oak\">Petrified Oak</a></b> Trees are found here. \n</p><p>Also, Here the new <b>Elderbark</b> axe is also often found, seated in a tree stump.\n</p><p>The <b>Elderbark</b> axe has a 1/40 chance of spawning, which is approximately 2.4%.\n</p><p>This place is also home to one of the quest pedestals for the <b><a href=\"/wiki/Uncertain_Pickaxe\" title=\"Uncertain Pickaxe\">Uncertain Pickaxe</a></b>.\n</p>\n<figure class=\"thumb  show-info-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File/Thumb\" style=\"width: 104px\"> \t<a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/e/e1/Oaklands_LostWood_Map.png/revision/latest?cb=20251004041553\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"Lost Woods (In map)\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/e/e1/Oaklands_LostWood_Map.png/revision/latest?cb=20251004041553\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"104\" height=\"95\" class=\"thumbimage\" data-image-name=\"Oaklands LostWood Map.png\" data-image-key=\"Oaklands_LostWood_Map.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" /></a> \t \t<figcaption class=\"thumbcaption\"> \t\t \t\t\t<a href=\"/wiki/File:Oaklands_LostWood_Map.png\" class=\"info-icon\"><svg><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-info-small\"></use></svg></a> \t\t \t\t \t\t \t\t\t<p class=\"caption\">Lost Woods (In map)</p> \t\t \t</figcaption> </figure>\n<figure class=\"thumb  show-info-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File/Thumb\" style=\"width: 446px\"> \t<a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/a/ab/Lost_Woods_.png/revision/latest?cb=20250603232437\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"Image of the Lost Woods sign and location in Finlay\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/a/ab/Lost_Woods_.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/446?cb=20250603232437\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"446\" height=\"221\" class=\"thumbimage\" data-image-name=\"Lost Woods .png\" data-image-key=\"Lost_Woods_.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" /></a> \t \t<figcaption class=\"thumbcaption\"> \t\t \t\t\t<a href=\"/wiki/File:Lost_Woods_.png\" class=\"info-icon\"><svg><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-info-small\"></use></svg></a> \t\t \t\t \t\t \t\t\t<p class=\"caption\">Image of the Lost Woods sign and location</p> \t\t \t</figcaption> </figure><figure class=\"thumb  show-info-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File/Thumb\" style=\"width: 379px\"> \t<a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/7/75/Lost_Woods_Pedestal.png/revision/latest?cb=20250604233238\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"An image of the location the Lost Woods pedestal used in many Oaklands quests.\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/7/75/Lost_Woods_Pedestal.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/379?cb=20250604233238\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"379\" height=\"265\" class=\"thumbimage\" data-image-name=\"Lost Woods Pedestal.png\" data-image-key=\"Lost_Woods_Pedestal.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" /></a> \t \t<figcaption class=\"thumbcaption\"> \t\t \t\t\t<a href=\"/wiki/File:Lost_Woods_Pedestal.png\" class=\"info-icon\"><svg><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-info-small\"></use></svg></a> \t\t \t\t \t\t \t\t\t<p class=\"caption\">Location of the Lost Woods pedestal used in many Oaklands quests</p> \t\t \t</figcaption> </figure>\n<figure class=\"thumb  show-info-icon\" typeof=\"